Project: College Equipment Booking System
User Journey: A student browsing equipment, viewing details, submitting a booking request with start and end dates, handling incomplete input, and receiving a pending review acknowledgement.

Screen Sequence & Requirements Mapping:
1. Browse equipment (Screen 1)  Linked to EB01 (Students can view available equipment)
2. Equipment details (Screen 2)  Supports selecting an item for EB02
3. Request equipment (Screen 3)  Linked to EB03 (Records start and end dates) & EB04 (Staff review stage)
4. Missing-date feedback (Screen 4)  Candidate validation behavior (needs confirmation)
5. Request submitted (Screen 5)  Linked to EB04 (Staff review acknowledgement, does not imply automatic approval)
